      "paperId": "ea93abc1f3e721cfa2651453b15d895e50e69b2f",
      "title": "Fact-Finding Without Rules: Habermas's Communicative Rationality as a Framework for Judicial Assessments of Digital Open-Source Information",
      "authors": [
